  "question": {
    "text": "The letters of the word $\\mathrm{COCHIN}$ are permuted and all the permutations are arranged in an alphabetical order as in an English dictionary. The number of words that appear before the word $\\mathrm{COCHIN}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
